            "target_entity_type": "Project",
            "paragraph": "The Copernicus Seasonal Forecast Package was developed by the CLIMADA team at ETH Zurich as part of the U-CLIMADAPT project, which aims to improve the usability of Copernicus data products for climate adaptation planning. This work was supported by the European Commission under the Framework Partnership Agreement on Copernicus User Uptake, 741 via the Action No. 2021-2-29 (U-CLIMADAPT).",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
